        <title>OpenCut</title>
        <link>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/opencut/</link>
        <pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 16:08:47 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/opencut/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1653276616125-2aa5d51469bb?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODY5NTM5ODN8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post OpenCut" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;opencut-appopencut&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/OpenCut-app/OpenCut&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenCut-app/OpenCut&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;table width=&#34;100%&#34;&gt;
  &lt;tr&gt;
    &lt;td align=&#34;left&#34; width=&#34;120&#34;&gt;
      &lt;img src=&#34;https://assets.opencut.app/branding/symbol.svg&#34; alt=&#34;OpenCut Logo&#34; width=&#34;100&#34; /&gt;
    &lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td align=&#34;right&#34;&gt;
      &lt;h1&gt;OpenCut&lt;/h1&gt;
      &lt;h3 style=&#34;margin-top: -10px;&#34;&gt;A free and open source video editor for web, desktop, and mobile.&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;/td&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/zmR9N35cjK&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/discord/1386309140057690133?label=Discord&amp;amp;logo=discord&amp;amp;logoColor=fff&amp;amp;color=5865F2&amp;amp;style=flat&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Discord&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://x.com/opencutapp&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-%40opencutapp-000?logo=x&amp;amp;logoColor=fff&amp;amp;style=flat&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;X&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;LICENSE&#34; &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green?style=flat&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;License: MIT&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;status&#34;&gt;Status
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenCut is being rewritten from the ground up.&lt;/strong&gt; What&amp;rsquo;s coming:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An Editor API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-class third party plugins (made possible by a plugin-first architecture)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desktop, mobile, and browser from one codebase (Rust core)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MCP server (for AI agents)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headless mode (automation, batch rendering)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A scripting tab directly in the editor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can still find the previous version at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/opencut-app/opencut-classic&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;opencut-app/opencut-classic&lt;/a&gt;, which is the one to reach for today. &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opencut.app&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;opencut.app&lt;/a&gt; still runs the classic version. The rewrite will live at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://new.opencut.app&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;new.opencut.app&lt;/a&gt; until it&amp;rsquo;s ready to take over.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;development&#34;&gt;Development
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Install &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://moonrepo.dev/proto&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;proto&lt;/a&gt; if you haven&amp;rsquo;t already:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linux, macOS, WSL:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;bash &amp;lt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;curl -fsSL https://moonrepo.dev/install/proto.sh&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Windows (PowerShell):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;irm &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;https&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;moonrepo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;dev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;install&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;proto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;ps1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;iex
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If shims fail to run, allow local scripts for your user:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;Set-ExecutionPolicy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-Scope&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;CurrentUser&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;RemoteSigned&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the repo root:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;proto use    &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# installs the tools pinned in .prototools&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;moon run web:dev       &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# localhost:5173&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;moon run api:dev       &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# localhost:8787&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;moon run desktop:dev   &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# see apps/desktop/README.md&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&amp;rsquo;re not set up to take outside contributions yet while the architecture is being designed. If you want to follow along, ask questions, or just hang out, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/zmR9N35cjK&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;join the Discord&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/opencut-app/opencut/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;open an issue&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;sponsors&#34;&gt;Sponsors
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;OpenCut is supported by companies that believe in open source creator tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://fal.ai?utm_source=github-opencut&amp;amp;utm_campaign=oss&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;strong&gt;fal.ai&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Generative image, video, and audio models all in one place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want your logo here? Reach out at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;mailto:sponsor@opencut.app&#34; &gt;sponsor@opencut.app&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;license&#34;&gt;License
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;LICENSE&#34; &gt;MIT&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>palmier-pro</title>
        <link>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/palmier-pro/</link>
        <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 18:47:42 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/palmier-pro/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1636744534523-0f110a9c5d63?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODIyMTE2MTd8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post palmier-pro" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;palmier-iopalmier-pro&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/palmier-io/palmier-pro&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;palmier-io/palmier-pro&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;palmier-pro&#34;&gt;Palmier Pro
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The video editor built for AI.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/palmier-io/palmier-pro/releases/latest/download/PalmierPro.dmg&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;./assets/macos-badge.png&#34; alt=&#34;Download Palmier Pro for macOS&#34; width=&#34;180&#34; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;i&gt;Requires macOS 26 (Tahoe) on Apple Silicon&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/Palmier_io&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/Follow-%40Palmier__io-000000?style=flat&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white&#34; alt=&#34;Follow on X&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://discord.com/invite/SMVW6pKYmg&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/Join-Discord-5865F2?style=flat&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&#34; alt=&#34;Join Discord&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/palmier&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/Y%20Combinator-S24-orange&#34; alt=&#34;Y Combinator S24&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.es.md&#34;&gt;Español&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.zh-CN.md&#34;&gt;简体中文&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.zh-TW.md&#34;&gt;繁體中文&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.ja.md&#34;&gt;日本語&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.ko.md&#34;&gt;한국어&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.vi.md&#34;&gt;Tiếng Việt&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.hi.md&#34;&gt;हिन्दी&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.bn.md&#34;&gt;বাংলা&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.ar.md&#34;&gt;العربية&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.it.md&#34;&gt;Italiano&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.pt-BR.md&#34;&gt;Português (Brasil)&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.fr.md&#34;&gt;Français&lt;/a&gt; ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;docs/readme/README.ru.md&#34;&gt;Русский&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;./assets/palmier-ui.png&#34; alt=&#34;Palmier Pro UI&#34; width=&#34;900&#34; /&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Palmier Pro is an open source video editor for Mac. You and your agent can generate and edit videos together inside the timeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;swift-native-video-editor&#34;&gt;Swift-native video editor
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We built Palmier Pro from scratch with Swift. The north star is Premiere Pro, with our take on integrating AI into the workflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;built-in-generative-ai&#34;&gt;Built-in Generative AI
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Generate videos and images with SOTA models like Seedance, Kling, Nano Banana Pro inside the timeline editor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;integrates-with-your-agents&#34;&gt;Integrates with your agents
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Connects your Claude/Codex/Cursor via MCP, or use the in-app agent to work on the same project together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;mcp-server&#34;&gt;MCP server
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;When the app is open, it exposes an MCP server at &lt;code&gt;http://127.0.0.1:19789/mcp&lt;/code&gt; via HTTP. To connect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Claude Code&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;claude mcp add --transport http palmier-pro http://127.0.0.1:19789/mcp
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Codex&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;codex mcp add palmier-pro --url http://127.0.0.1:19789/mcp
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cursor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way is go inside the app &lt;code&gt;Help&lt;/code&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;MCP Instructions&lt;/code&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;Install in Cursor&lt;/code&gt;, or install manually by adding this to &lt;code&gt;~/.cursor/mcp.json&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &amp;#34;mcpServers&amp;#34;: {
